<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xml:lang="zh-CN"><generator uri="https://jekyllrb.com/" version="4.4.1">Jekyll</generator><link href="https://ly5681672-max.github.io/feed.xml" rel="self" type="application/atom+xml"/><link href="https://ly5681672-max.github.io/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" hreflang="zh-CN"/><updated>2026-10-21T02:41:27+00:00</updated><id>https://ly5681672-max.github.io/feed.xml</id><title type="html">blank</title><subtitle>李亚倩（Yaqian Li）的学术主页，展示人工智能辅助催化剂筛选、第一性原理计算、微观动力学、学术论文与 CatMAP 学习笔记。 </subtitle><entry><title type="html">2026-10-21-catmap-05-knowledge-points</title><link href="https://ly5681672-max.github.io/blog/2026/catmap-05-knowledge-points/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="2026-10-21-catmap-05-knowledge-points"/><published>2026-10-21T02:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-10-21T02:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://ly5681672-max.github.io/blog/2026/catmap-05-knowledge-points</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://ly5681672-max.github.io/blog/2026/catmap-05-knowledge-points/"><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://chatgpt.com/s/t_6ad8227edc648191b3ab63a526ab3a42">https://chatgpt.com/s/t_6ad8227edc648191b3ab63a526ab3a42</a></p>]]></content><author><name></name></author><summary type="html"><![CDATA[https://chatgpt.com/s/t_6ad8227edc648191b3ab63a526ab3a42]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">大牛 04</title><link href="https://ly5681672-max.github.io/blog/2026/%E5%A4%A7%E7%89%9B-04/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="大牛 04"/><published>2026-10-19T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-10-19T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://ly5681672-max.github.io/blog/2026/%E5%A4%A7%E7%89%9B-04</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://ly5681672-max.github.io/blog/2026/%E5%A4%A7%E7%89%9B-04/"><![CDATA[]]></content><author><name></name></author><summary type="html"><![CDATA[]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">catmap-03-林栋师兄讨论catmap初步结果</title><link href="https://ly5681672-max.github.io/blog/2026/catmap-03-%E8%AE%A8%E8%AE%BA/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="catmap-03-林栋师兄讨论catmap初步结果"/><published>2026-10-18T02:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-10-18T02:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://ly5681672-max.github.io/blog/2026/catmap-03-%E8%AE%A8%E8%AE%BA</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://ly5681672-max.github.io/blog/2026/catmap-03-%E8%AE%A8%E8%AE%BA/"><![CDATA[<p>汇报2026_10_13.pptx</p> <p>1.动力学表达式中 Rpair字母表达有误</p> <p>2.对于覆盖度OOH没有分析 分析不全</p> <p>分析完对照完整catmap分析文章 看看哪些缺</p> <p>3.火山图活性排序有误 Ti活性太高</p> <p>修改反馈</p> <p><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ly5681672-max/ly5681672-max.github.io/main/assets/img/learning-notes/2026-10-18-catmap-03-%E8%AE%A8%E8%AE%BA.md-2026-10-19_14-43-40-a79394c8.png" alt="2026-10-18-catmap-03-讨论.md-2026-10-19_14-43-40-a79394c8"></p> <p>CatMAP 微观动力学分析中： <img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ly5681672-max/ly5681672-max.github.io/main/assets/img/learning-notes/2026-10-18-catmap-03-%E8%AE%A8%E8%AE%BA.md-2026-10-19_14-44-20-5971b66a.png" alt="2026-10-18-catmap-03-讨论.md-2026-10-19_14-44-20-5971b66a"></p> <p><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ly5681672-max/ly5681672-max.github.io/main/assets/img/learning-notes/2026-10-18-catmap-03-%E8%AE%A8%E8%AE%BA.md-2026-10-19_14-51-34-37fdd826.png" alt="2026-10-18-catmap-03-讨论.md-2026-10-19_14-51-34-37fdd826"></p> <p>Jacobian 矩阵特征值：</p> <p><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ly5681672-max/ly5681672-max.github.io/main/assets/img/learning-notes/2026-10-18-catmap-03-%E8%AE%A8%E8%AE%BA.md-2026-10-19_16-39-46-aea1bcba.png" alt="2026-10-18-catmap-03-讨论.md-2026-10-19_16-39-46-aea1bcba"></p> <p>最慢模态的特征松弛时间：</p> \[\boxed{\tau=\frac{1}{|\lambda|}}\] <p><a href="https://chatgpt.com/s/t_6ad5c9474cf88191a8c233386edde5b1">https://chatgpt.com/s/t_6ad5c9474cf88191a8c233386edde5b1</a></p> <p><a href="https://chatgpt.com/s/t_6ad5d7a436348191bedcd43defc4b76a">https://chatgpt.com/s/t_6ad5d7a436348191bedcd43defc4b76a</a></p> <p>其中OOH覆盖度和TOF没有关联图 根本原因是六步机理不合理 需要变为 <img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ly5681672-max/ly5681672-max.github.io/main/assets/img/learning-notes/2026-10-18-catmap-03-%E8%AE%A8%E8%AE%BA.md-2026-10-19_17-37-55-818b57fc.png" alt="2026-10-18-catmap-03-讨论.md-2026-10-19_17-37-55-818b57fc"></p> <p>端点势垒近似：没有单独计算真实过渡态时，暂时用反应初态和终态中能量较高的一端，作为模型中的有效势垒顶</p> <p>绝对稳态残差：</p> <p><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ly5681672-max/ly5681672-max.github.io/main/assets/img/learning-notes/2026-10-18-catmap-03-%E8%AE%A8%E8%AE%BA.md-2026-10-20_10-39-39-8dcea168.png" alt="2026-10-18-catmap-03-讨论.md-2026-10-20_10-39-39-8dcea168"></p> <p><a href="https://chatgpt.com/s/t_6ad6d08b483c8191a97d7a02641cfb02">https://chatgpt.com/s/t_6ad6d08b483c8191a97d7a02641cfb02</a></p> <p>TOF：模型中的“有效活性中心”是由反应网络和位点归一化方式定义的，不一定与真实催化剂中的 Ti 原子数量一一对应</p> <p>用于判断状态能量对TOF的局部敏感性时</p> \[\boxed{ X_i=-k_{\mathrm B}T \frac{\partial\ln(\mathrm{TOF})}{\partial G_i} }\] <p><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ly5681672-max/ly5681672-max.github.io/main/assets/img/learning-notes/2026-10-18-catmap-03-%E8%AE%A8%E8%AE%BA.md-2026-10-20_10-53-42-f957d2c8.png" alt="2026-10-18-catmap-03-讨论.md-2026-10-20_10-53-42-f957d2c8"></p> <p>玻尔兹曼常数和普朗克常量</p> <p><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ly5681672-max/ly5681672-max.github.io/main/assets/img/learning-notes/2026-10-18-catmap-03-%E8%AE%A8%E8%AE%BA.md-2026-10-20_10-56-38-0e273fed.png" alt="2026-10-18-catmap-03-讨论.md-2026-10-20_10-56-38-0e273fed"></p> \[k_{\mathrm B}=8.617333262\times10^{-5}\ \mathrm{eV/K}\] \[\boxed{k_{\mathrm B}T\approx0.02871\ \mathrm{eV}}\] <p>需要注意：在 CatMAP 的常规微观动力学分析中，热活化因子和 DRC 公式通常直接使用 \(k_{\mathrm B}T\)，不需要直接代入普朗克常数 \(h\)。</p> <p>用于判断状态能量对TOF的局部敏感性时：</p> <p><img src="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ly5681672-max/ly5681672-max.github.io/main/assets/img/learning-notes/2026-10-18-catmap-03-%E8%AE%A8%E8%AE%BA.md-2026-10-20_16-34-13-69ab5e1c.png" alt="2026-10-18-catmap-03-讨论.md-2026-10-20_16-34-13-69ab5e1c"></p> <p>公式推导</p> \[\frac{d\ln x}{dx}=\frac{1}{x}\] <p>根据微分法则：</p> \[\frac{d\ln(\mathrm{TOF})}{d(\mathrm{TOF})} =\frac{1}{\mathrm{TOF}}\]]]></content><author><name></name></author><summary type="html"><![CDATA[汇报2026_10_13.pptx]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">catmap-02-项目学习笔记</title><link href="https://ly5681672-max.github.io/blog/2026/catmap-02-knowledge-points/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="catmap-02-项目学习笔记"/><published>2026-10-16T02:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-10-16T02:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://ly5681672-max.github.io/blog/2026/catmap-02-knowledge-points</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://ly5681672-max.github.io/blog/2026/catmap-02-knowledge-points/"><![CDATA[<p>1.当前BEP关系下</p> \[\begin{gathered} u=\Delta G_{2}+2.0922766923,\qquad z=E_{\rm form}^{legacy}(\mathrm{OOH}^{*})+4.3098743846,\\ \boxed{\widehat Y_{1}\simeq0.412123+0.370377u+0.200217z-0.309777z^2}. \end{gathered}\] <p>2.tico的TOF预测失效？</p> <p>Ti–Co 预测失败的主要统计原因已经基本定位于 ΔG₂ 的极端外推；尚未确定的是这一异常描述符究竟源于真实的催化剂能量特征，还是数据参考与状态定义的不一致</p> <p><a href="https://chatgpt.com/s/t_6ad197760c6c8191aabe5a6cea0e41ef">查看相关讨论</a></p> <p>TS1的末态需要重算下，Ti–Co 的特殊反应能来自初态稳定与终态相对不稳定的共同作用 <a href="https://chatgpt.com/s/t_6ad199dfd13c819181cc122f5e06239c">查看 TS1 相关讨论</a></p> <p>3.到底按照依据DFT结果得到 TOF排序 还是按照catmap的BEP关系得到 TOF排序 作为真实的？ <a href="https://chatgpt.com/s/t_6ad48a8c6874819188b7a9c96d5b0103">https://chatgpt.com/s/t_6ad48a8c6874819188b7a9c96d5b0103</a></p>]]></content><author><name></name></author><summary type="html"><![CDATA[1.当前BEP关系下]]></summary></entry><entry><title type="html">catmap-01-项目学习笔记</title><link href="https://ly5681672-max.github.io/blog/2026/catmap-01-knowledge-points/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="catmap-01-项目学习笔记"/><published>2026-10-15T07:30:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-10-15T07:30:00+00:00</updated><id>https://ly5681672-max.github.io/blog/2026/catmap-01-knowledge-points</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://ly5681672-max.github.io/blog/2026/catmap-01-knowledge-points/"><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://chatgpt.com/s/t_6ad08beba18881919a632c77f4b3ad0f">https://chatgpt.com/s/t_6ad08beba18881919a632c77f4b3ad0f</a></p> <p>样本内BEP能够改变TOF排序，但<strong>LOOCV</strong>结果说明该BEP模型对Ti–Co缺乏稳定的外推预测能力</p> <p><strong>LOOCV</strong>：Leave-One-Out Cross-Validation，留一交叉验证</p> <p><img src="/assets/img/catmap-knowledge-points/image.png" alt="CatMAP 学习图片 1"/></p> <p>另外25个复用了5×5阶段输入<strong>哈希</strong>一致的已验证CatMAP结果</p> <p><strong>哈希（Hash）</strong>：是一种将数据通过特定算法转换为固定长度标识值的技术，相当于给数据生成一个“数字指纹”。</p> <p>在计算催化领域，哈希主要用于识别、管理和验证科研数据，而不是描述催化剂的物理化学性质。</p> <p>主要有三个用途：</p> <ol> <li>结构识别： 为催化剂结构、吸附构型或反应中间体生成标识，便于检索和去重。</li> <li>数据完整性验证： 通过 SHA-256 等哈希算法，检查 DFT 计算文件是否被修改。</li> <li>数据库管理： 在高通量催化剂筛选和机器学习中，快速关联结构、计算结果及相关数据。</li> </ol> <p>举例： 对 Ti–W 催化剂的 DFT 结构文件计算哈希值。如果文件内容发生变化，其哈希值通常也会改变，从而帮助判断文件是否被修改。但不同哈希值不一定意味着催化结构在物理上不同。</p> <p>一句话总结：<strong>哈希是科研数据的“数字指纹”，主要用于催化结构与计算数据的识别、去重和完整性验证，本身不是催化活性描述符。</strong></p> <p>这个单循环六步反应网络，稳态下各步净通量原则上应一致。?</p> <p><img src="/assets/img/catmap-knowledge-points/image-1.png" alt="CatMAP 学习图片 2"/></p> <p>一个没有分支的闭合反应循环，在稳态下，每一步生成的中间体必须被下一步以相同速率消耗，否则中间体就会不断积累或减少，系统便不再处于稳态。</p>]]></content><author><name></name></author><summary type="html"><![CDATA[https://chatgpt.com/s/t_6ad08beba18881919a632c77f4b3ad0f]]></summary></entry></feed>